{
  "id": "dialogue.hiori.support",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "支えていきたい",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hiori.support",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hiori.support",
    "idolId": "hiori",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。不过今天已经很晚了，得回去了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不……还有时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "有干劲是好事，但把身体搞坏了就什么都没了。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "休息也是偶像的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……我明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好。那太晚了，我送你。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……好。谢谢您。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，练到这么晚，真的很了不起。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不，这是必要的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……制作人您才是，工作到这么晚，不累吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这点程度没什么。工作本身也挺开心的。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "开心……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……怎么了？一脸不可思议的样子。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "啊，不……我不太懂\"工作很开心\"是什么意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，虽说不是只有开心的事，不过我的工作是……",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "是为了灯织",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "我自己决定的事",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "有值得做的事",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好——！工作总算告一段落了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "总之今天就到这里，回去吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……回去之前，得确认一下门窗。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯？练习室那边还亮着灯……？）",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "呼……呼……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "灯织……？这么晚还在练，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "啊，制作人……辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你在练之前说不太擅长的那个舞步？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "是的。还有点不放心……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是为了灯织啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "为了我，吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-03"
      },
      "2-03": {
        "id": "2-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。我努力一分，就会变成你的结果。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-04"
      },
      "2-04": {
        "id": "2-04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以才会觉得开心，也不会想放弃。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-05"
      },
      "2-05": {
        "id": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……是这样吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-06"
      },
      "2-06": {
        "id": "2-06",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "那我也得能回应这份期待才行。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-07"
      },
      "2-07": {
        "id": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我期待着，灯织。明天也一起加油！"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为是我自己决定要做的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "有不顺利的时候，但不能半途而废。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-03"
      },
      "3-03": {
        "id": "3-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "认真起来才开心……大概是这种感觉吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-04"
      },
      "3-04": {
        "id": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……那种心情，我好像有点明白。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-05"
      },
      "3-05": {
        "id": "3-05",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我最讨厌半途而废了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-06"
      },
      "3-06": {
        "id": "3-06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……灯织一直都那么认真。"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为越是努力，回报就越明显，所以很开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……以前我不明白，最近有点懂了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-03"
      },
      "4-03": {
        "id": "4-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……那真是太好了！",
        "nextNodeId": "4-04"
      },
      "4-04": {
        "id": "4-04",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……您为什么看起来那么高兴？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-05"
      },
      "4-05": {
        "id": "4-05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为知道你在享受工作，我就特别高兴。"
      }
    }
  },
